text = "This preview now uses the same back-button silhouette, additive outline, shader-tinted image, font, and runtime clamp math as the in-game bookmark.

Do not drag BookmarkPreview directly anymore. Select the scene root and adjust the exported values in the Inspector:
- position_x_offset_from_back_button
- position_y_offset_from_back_button
- label_left / top / right / bottom

Those values map directly to CardEditorBaseDeckBookmarkLayout.cs."
